sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER003 as PER-003<br/>Corporate Client
    participant PER053 as PER-053<br/>Treasury Dealer
    participant PER058 as PER-058<br/>MLRO
    participant SVC007 as SVC-007<br/>Treasury Services<br/>(CAP-002)
    participant SVC102 as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant SVC051 as SVC-051<br/>Sanctions Screening<br/>(CAP-005)
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053<br/>Notification Service

    Note over PER003,SVC053: EXC-001: Sanctions Hit on Counterparty — Post-Booking Hold

    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Note over PER003,SVC007: PH-061: Trade Execution (abbreviated — same as happy path up to booking)
        PER003->>SVC007: POST /treasury/fx-trades/{trade_id}/accept {quote_id}
        SVC007->>SVC007: FXQuote.status = accepted<br/>FXTrade.status = booked<br/>dealt_at set, value_date set
        SVC007-)SVC102: EVT-085: FXTradeExecuted — trade booked ✓
        SVC007-)SVC102: EVT-089: FXCounterpartySanctionsScreened [CROSS-CAPABILITY ▶]<br/>topic: compliance.sanctions-screening<br/>{trade_id, client_id, client_legal_name: "Restricted Metals Corp",<br/>screening_request_id: SCR-2026-004521}
        SVC007-->>PER003: 200 OK {trade_id, status: booked}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over SVC102,SVC051: CAP-005: Sanctions Screening
        SVC102-)SVC051: Delivers EVT-089 [◀ CROSS-CAPABILITY received by CAP-005]
        SVC051->>SVC051: OFSI screen: "Restricted Metals Corp"<br/>▶ MATCH DETECTED — OFSI Consolidated List entry<br/>Match type: exact name match, SDN list<br/>Confidence: HIGH (97%)
        SVC051-)SVC102: FXCounterpartySanctionsHitDetected [CROSS-CAPABILITY ▶]<br/>topic: compliance.sanctions-screening<br/>{screening_request_id: SCR-2026-004521, trade_id,<br/>outcome: hit, list: OFSI_CONSOLIDATED, confidence: 0.97}
        SVC102-)SVC007: Delivers hit notification [◀ CROSS-CAPABILITY received by CAP-002]
    end

    rect rgb(255, 180, 180)
        Note over SVC007,SVC053: Settlement Hold Applied
        SVC007->>SVC007: Creates ENT-042 (FXSettlement)<br/>settlement_status = sanctions_hold
        SVC007->>SVC007: FXTrade.status = settlement_held<br/>Settlement instruction NOT published (EVT-087 withheld)
        SVC007-)SVC102: FXSettlementHeld (internal alert event)<br/>{trade_id, settlement_id, hold_reason: sanctions_hit,<br/>screening_request_id: SCR-2026-004521}
        SVC102-)SVC053: Deliver alert → MLRO notification (secure case management channel)
        SVC053-->>PER058: URGENT: Sanctions hold on FX trade {trade_id}<br/>Client: Restricted Metals Corp — OFSI match (HIGH confidence)<br/>Action required within 4 hours
        Note over PER053,PER058: Tipping-off prohibition active (POCA 2002 s333A)<br/>PER-003 NOT notified of specific reason for settlement delay
        SVC053-->>PER003: Generic settlement delay notification:<br/>"Your trade is under review — you will be contacted within 24 hours"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 220, 200)
        Note over PER058,SVC007: MLRO Resolution (out-of-band)
        PER058->>PER058: Reviews OFSI match — false positive<br/>(name collision; different entity; OFSI reference confirms)<br/>Authorises settlement release with documented rationale
        PER058->>SVC007: POST /treasury/fx-trades/{trade_id}/sanctions-release<br/>{mlro_id, resolution: false_positive, ofsi_reference, rationale}
        SVC007->>SVC007: FXSettlement.settlement_status = initiated<br/>FXTrade.status = confirmed<br/>Resolution logged on FXTrade (immutable audit entry)
        SVC007-)SVC102: EVT-087: FXSettlementInitiated — settlement released<br/>(proceeds as per happy path PH-063)
        Note over SVC007: Settlement proceeds via CAP-003 as happy path
    end
